'''Presents of Mind (Insane)''' is a celebration stage that features enemies from Seasonal Events. Unlike other [[:Category:Monthly Event All-Stars Stages|Monthly Event All-Stars Stages]], it drops random [[Battle Items]] in sets of 2 when completed (except Speed Up and Cat CPU, which drop in sets of 4). It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

